### Resolve availability for a title
GET http://localhost:8080/api/search?imdbId=tt0292644
Accept: application/json

### ... and one that is not cached yet
GET http://localhost:8080/api/search?imdbId=tt0101452
Accept: application/json

### How many watchlist titles have never been scraped (ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cache/uncached
Accept: application/json

### Pre-cache all of them (ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cache
Accept: application/json

### The current principal
GET http://localhost:8080/api/me
Accept: application/json
